  "estudio": "Verbos pronominales frecuentes",
  "alumno": "Learn the verb and its particles as one unit"
 },
 "intro": "Pronominal verbs combine a basic verb root with one or two fixed clitic particles (**ci**, **ne**, **la**, **si**) that completely change its lexical meaning. At B2 level it is essential to master them as unitary lexical blocks: **farcela** (to manage it / to achieve it), **cavarsela** (to get by / to come through), **andarsene** (to leave), **sentirsela** (to feel up to it) and **approfittarne** (to take advantage of the opportunity).",
